10
00:01:34,334 --> 00:01:39,542
One hundred years ago , on the 21st of April ,

11
00:01:39,917 --> 00:01:43,459
out on the waters around Spivey Point ,

12
00:01:43,917 --> 00:01:47,501
a small clipper ship Drew toward land .

13
00:01:48,251 --> 00:01:52,959
Suddenly , out of the night , the fog rolled in .

14
00:01:53,376 --> 00:01:55,792
For a moment , they could see nothing ,

15
00:01:55,917 --> 00:01:57,834
not a foot ahead of them .

16
00:01:58,584 --> 00:02:01,542
And then they saw a light .

17
00:02:02,334 --> 00:02:07,376
By God , it was a fire burning on the shore ,

18
00:02:08,042 --> 00:02:12,167
strong enough to penetrate the swirling mist .

19
00:02:12,542 --> 00:02:16,584
They steered a course toward the light ,

20
00:02:16,667 --> 00:02:20,876
but it was a campfire like this one .

21
00:02:22,084 --> 00:02:24,917
The ship crashed against the rocks .

22
00:02:25,709 --> 00:02:27,667
The hull sheared in two .

23
00:02:27,751 --> 00:02:29,626
The mast snapped like a twig ,

24
00:02:30,751 --> 00:02:35,251
and the wreckage sank with all the men aboard .

25
00:02:37,584 --> 00:02:39,251
At the bottom of the sea

26
00:02:39,334 --> 00:02:42,792
lay the Elizabeth Dane with her crew ,

27
00:02:43,292 --> 00:02:46,501
their lungs filled with salt water ,

28
00:02:46,792 --> 00:02:50,917
their eyes open and staring into the darkness .

29
00:02:51,626 --> 00:02:55,126
And above , as suddenly as it had come ,

30
00:02:55,209 --> 00:02:59,501
the fog lifted , receded back across the ocean ,

31
00:02:59,876 --> 00:03:02,126
[ almost whispering ] and never came again .

32
00:03:03,251 --> 00:03:06,292
But it is told by the fishermen

33
00:03:06,376 --> 00:03:08,917
and their fathers and grandfathers

34
00:03:09,376 --> 00:03:13,126
that when the fog returns to Antonio Bay ,

35
00:03:13,792 --> 00:03:16,959
the men at the bottom of the sea ,

36
00:03:17,334 --> 00:03:20,167
out in the water by Spivey Point ,

37
00:03:20,834 --> 00:03:25,792
will rise up and search for the campfire

38
00:03:26,251 --> 00:03:30,917
that led them to their dark and icy death .

39
00:03:33,334 --> 00:03:35,001
