129
00:13:00,459 --> 00:13:01,667
That 's close enough .

130
00:13:04,167 --> 00:13:06,376
- Make it ? - Yeah . Thank you .

131
00:13:17,709 --> 00:13:20,251
- Sip ? - Thanks .

132
00:13:27,459 --> 00:13:28,834
Listen , I never hitchhiked before .

133
00:13:30,459 --> 00:13:31,667
