136
00:13:37,501 --> 00:13:38,501
Yes , I am .

137
00:13:39,834 --> 00:13:41,001
Yes , I am weird .

138
00:13:41,084 --> 00:13:42,001
- You are weird . You 're weird . - Yes .

139
00:13:42,084 --> 00:13:43,542
Thank God you 're weird .

140
00:13:43,709 --> 00:13:46,251
The last one I had was so normal , it was disgusting .

141
00:13:46,792 --> 00:13:48,126
He picked me up in Santa Barbara .

142
00:13:48,209 --> 00:13:50,459
By the time we got to Carmel he wanted to marry me .

143
00:13:50,542 --> 00:13:52,917
Oh , yeah . I thought you never hitchhiked before .

144
00:13:57,501 --> 00:13:58,626
Not before last week .

145
00:13:59,459 --> 00:14:00,417
You 're my ...

146
00:14:02,417 --> 00:14:03,501
thirteenth ride .

147
00:14:03,792 --> 00:14:06,459
Oh , great . Weird and unlucky .

148
00:14:07,417 --> 00:14:08,417
We 'll see .

149
00:14:12,126 --> 00:14:13,584
Look out ! Oh !

150
00:14:15,126 --> 00:14:16,876
