151
00:14:20,501 --> 00:14:21,709
- Are you all right ? - I 'm fine .

152
00:14:21,792 --> 00:14:23,292
- You 're sure ? - I 'm fine . I think so .

153
00:14:23,959 --> 00:14:25,376
What the hell was - -

154
00:14:25,959 --> 00:14:27,959
[ music playing on the radio ]

155
00:14:32,251 --> 00:14:34,251
[ Stevie ] It 's exactly twelve minutes after midnight ,

156
00:14:34,792 --> 00:14:36,042
and this is Stevie Wayne ,

157
00:14:36,126 --> 00:14:37,167
- your night light , - Let 's get out of here .

158
00:14:37,292 --> 00:14:39,209
around , until about ... 1 : 00 .

159
00:14:40,001 --> 00:14:43,084
I 'm high tonight in the KAB lighthouse on Spivey Point .

160
00:14:43,167 --> 00:14:45,751
And in case you 've forgotten , it 's April 21st .

161
00:14:45,959 --> 00:14:47,917
And a Happy Birthday for Antonio Bay .

162
00:14:48,792 --> 00:14:50,917
Now , there 's a celebration planned for tonight .

163
00:14:51,626 --> 00:14:54,084
So if you 're so excited about it you can 't sleep ,

164
00:14:54,959 --> 00:14:57,084
well , stay up with me ,

165
00:14:57,167 --> 00:15:00,667
and I 'll figure out some way to keep you occupied .

166
00:15:02,834 --> 00:15:03,709
Or not .

167
00:15:03,834 --> 00:15:05,501
