169
00:15:09,417 --> 00:15:10,542
KAB .

170
00:15:10,626 --> 00:15:11,542
Hi , sweetheart .

171
00:15:11,626 --> 00:15:13,501
Hi , Dan . What have you got ?

172
00:15:13,584 --> 00:15:15,126
Well , I 'm just calling to see if you 're lonely ,

173
00:15:15,209 --> 00:15:16,626
