174
00:15:16,709 --> 00:15:18,042
Never lonely , Dan .

175
00:15:18,376 --> 00:15:19,667
I thought you were off work at 8 : 00 .

176
00:15:19,751 --> 00:15:22,334
I changed shifts so I can make it to the big party tonight .

177
00:15:22,626 --> 00:15:24,042
Will you be there ?

178
00:15:24,876 --> 00:15:26,959
Well ... until I can talk someone else

179
00:15:27,042 --> 00:15:29,959
into giving up city life for Antonio Bay , I 'm it .

180
00:15:30,334 --> 00:15:31,751
And " it " means day and night .

181
00:15:31,876 --> 00:15:33,167
Too much work .

182
00:15:33,251 --> 00:15:35,042
Well , that 's what I get for owning a station .

183
00:15:35,126 --> 00:15:37,251
