198
00:16:04,917 --> 00:16:08,917
Ahoy , mateys . This is KAB , Antonio Bay .

199
00:16:09,584 --> 00:16:12,876
Stevie Wayne here beaming a signal across the sea .

200
00:16:13,417 --> 00:16:14,792
To the men on The Sea Grass ,

201
00:16:15,084 --> 00:16:17,751
15 miles out tonight , a warm hello ,

202
00:16:18,126 --> 00:16:20,542
and keep a watch out for that fog bank

203
00:16:20,626 --> 00:16:22,126
