204
00:16:22,709 --> 00:16:26,501
In the meantime , relax with me while I play this song

205
00:16:26,584 --> 00:16:29,917
from the Coupe de Villes ... dedicated just to you .

206
00:16:30,667 --> 00:16:32,209
Boy , would I like to meet her .

207
00:16:32,292 --> 00:16:34,292
I saw her at a grocery store one day .

208
00:16:34,459 --> 00:16:36,126
- And ? - You would like to meet her .

209
00:16:36,251 --> 00:16:39,167
She 's crazy . There 's no fog bank out there .

210
00:16:39,584 --> 00:16:40,959
