211
00:16:41,042 --> 00:16:43,042
- She owns that lighthouse . - I know that .

212
00:16:43,126 --> 00:16:44,751
Her son plays little league with my kid brother .

213
00:16:44,834 --> 00:16:45,917
She 's a mother ?

214
00:16:46,251 --> 00:16:47,959
[ laughs ] I thought you were happily married .

215
00:16:48,042 --> 00:16:51,626
- [ scoffs ] Not that happy . - There 's no fog bank out there .

216
00:16:57,959 --> 00:17:01,792
Hey . There 's a fog bank out there .

217
00:17:04,126 --> 00:17:06,626
All right . I 'm drunk enough .

218
00:17:06,917 --> 00:17:08,167
Let 's go back .

219
00:17:09,084 --> 00:17:10,584
All right , all right .

220
00:17:14,792 --> 00:17:15,917
Al , come here .

221
00:17:17,501 --> 00:17:19,209
- Just give him a hand . - Come here .

222
00:17:20,959 --> 00:17:23,584
[ ominous music mixed with the radio ]

223
00:17:31,876 --> 00:17:32,917
What was that ?

224
00:17:34,292 --> 00:17:35,584
