228
00:18:02,251 --> 00:18:03,376
Come here .

229
00:18:06,501 --> 00:18:07,376
What was that ?

230
00:18:16,001 --> 00:18:17,917
- [ engine shuts down ] - It 's the generator .

231
00:18:19,792 --> 00:18:21,459
Wha - - wha - -

232
00:18:25,959 --> 00:18:26,834
Al .

233
00:18:34,876 --> 00:18:36,167
