255
00:20:30,376 --> 00:20:32,084
It 's 12 : 43 ...

256
00:20:32,834 --> 00:20:37,376
and I 've got four in a row for you right here on KAB .

257
00:20:37,501 --> 00:20:40,209
- [ click ] - [ slow music starts playing ]

258
00:21:14,709 --> 00:21:16,167
Nothing but water , Stevie .

259
00:21:19,334 --> 00:21:20,834
But it sure beats Chicago .

260
00:21:22,751 --> 00:21:24,792
[ telephone rings ]

261
00:21:27,126 --> 00:21:28,209
KAB .

262
00:21:28,626 --> 00:21:29,709
I like what you said

263
00:21:29,792 --> 00:21:32,209
