1044
01:14:18,251 --> 01:14:19,167
[ Nick ] Father ?

1045
01:14:19,251 --> 01:14:21,001
Is there a basement or cellar in here ?

1046
01:14:21,084 --> 01:14:22,876
- We can 't hide any longer . - We have to try !

1047
01:14:22,959 --> 01:14:24,959
No matter where we go , it will find us .

1048
01:14:29,667 --> 01:14:31,084
Is there a basement or cellar here , Father ?

1049
01:14:31,167 --> 01:14:32,792
There 's a study in back . I 'll show you the way .

1050
01:14:32,876 --> 01:14:34,667
Come on . Hurry .

1051
01:14:34,834 --> 01:14:36,584
Come on . Give me that .

1052
01:14:44,709 --> 01:14:46,792
[ dramatic music intensifies ]

1053
01:15:06,376 --> 01:15:07,626
The fog is sweeping inland .

1054
01:15:09,709 --> 01:15:12,042
It 's almost like a wall across the east end of town .

1055
01:15:37,167 --> 01:15:38,417
Blake and his men have come for us .

1056
01:15:38,501 --> 01:15:40,376
- Who 's Blake ? - Oh , it 's in the journal .

1057
01:15:40,459 --> 01:15:42,417
- What journal ? - I don 't know . It 's here somewhere .

1058
01:15:42,501 --> 01:15:44,001
- Father , where 's the journal ? - What are you talking about ?

1059
01:15:44,084 --> 01:15:45,251
- What ? - Where 's the journal ?

1060
01:15:45,334 --> 01:15:46,667
It 's - - It 's in there .

1061
01:15:51,959 --> 01:15:53,792
[ doors squeaking ]

1062
01:15:53,876 --> 01:15:54,834
Over by the window ?

1063
01:15:54,917 --> 01:15:57,292
- It can do us no good now . - It 's all we 've got .

1064
01:15:57,501 --> 01:15:59,334
If anything happens , just lock the door .

1065
01:15:59,751 --> 01:16:01,667
Get back . Shut the door .

1066
01:16:01,751 --> 01:16:02,876
[ doors squeaking ]

1067
01:16:11,792 --> 01:16:13,584
[ pounding ]

1068
01:16:15,751 --> 01:16:18,542
[ pounding ]

1069
01:16:21,459 --> 01:16:23,959
[ pounding gets closer ]

1070
01:16:42,167 --> 01:16:44,626
- " Six must die . " That was on the ... - The three men on the Sea Grass .

1071
01:16:44,709 --> 01:16:46,501
- And the weatherman is four . - [ Andy ] Mrs. Kobritz .

1072
01:16:46,584 --> 01:16:49,251
- Yeah , five . - And one of us makes six .

1073
01:16:49,376 --> 01:16:50,584
That 's what they want . They 've come back

1074
01:16:50,667 --> 01:16:52,376
for the six original conspirators .

1075
01:16:52,459 --> 01:16:53,709
- Six other lives to take the place . - There must be something in here !

1076
01:16:53,792 --> 01:16:56,334
- It 's me they want . I am the - - - Why would they want you ?

1077
01:16:56,417 --> 01:16:57,959
Wait , Father . You didn 't read us this .

1078
01:16:58,042 --> 01:16:59,959
Look . " Were it possible to raise the dead ,

1079
01:17:00,042 --> 01:17:02,417
I would return Blake 's fortune to him intact ,

1080
01:17:02,501 --> 01:17:05,376
save the money spent on these walls that hide it . "

1081
01:17:05,501 --> 01:17:07,001
" My fellow conspirators believe

1082
01:17:07,084 --> 01:17:09,751
that the confiscated fortune has been stolen from them ,

1083
01:17:09,917 --> 01:17:11,917
when in fact , I am the thief ,

1084
01:17:12,001 --> 01:17:14,167
and God 's Temple is the tomb of gold . "

1085
01:17:14,876 --> 01:17:17,459
" I am the thief , and God 's Temple is the tomb ... "

1086
01:17:17,542 --> 01:17:18,542
[ crash ]

1087
01:17:20,209 --> 01:17:21,876
Now , wait . Get - - get rid of that !

1088
01:17:22,209 --> 01:17:23,209
Nick !

1089
01:17:23,917 --> 01:17:26,126
Get out of the way !

1090
01:17:26,376 --> 01:17:29,751
[ pounding on door ]

1091
01:17:37,542 --> 01:17:38,501
[ clank ]

1092
01:17:47,501 --> 01:17:49,667
- Give me a hand . - Andy , stay right there .

1093
01:17:52,501 --> 01:17:53,376
Nick .

1094
01:18:04,709 --> 01:18:05,709
[ screams ]

1095
01:18:14,751 --> 01:18:15,792
The gold .

1096
01:18:21,876 --> 01:18:23,709
[ sloshing ]

1097
01:18:35,167 --> 01:18:37,417
He melted down the gold into this .

1098
01:18:39,459 --> 01:18:40,542
[ screams ]

1099
01:18:41,542 --> 01:18:42,584
[ Elizabeth ] Somebody help her !

1100
01:18:51,251 --> 01:18:52,751
- [ Nick groans ] - Nick , no !

1101
01:18:56,459 --> 01:18:57,667
Don 't go in there !

1102
01:18:58,667 --> 01:18:59,959
[ shouting in pain ]

1103
01:19:03,917 --> 01:19:05,084
[ wind howling ]

1104
01:19:06,667 --> 01:19:08,626
[ threatening music grows louder ]

1105
01:19:39,251 --> 01:19:41,667
Blake , I have your gold .

1106
01:19:49,501 --> 01:19:50,542
[ silently ] Blake ?

1107
01:19:59,501 --> 01:20:01,417
[ metal clanking ]

1108
01:20:07,501 --> 01:20:08,626
[ someone screams ]

1109
01:20:28,334 --> 01:20:29,917
This is your gold , Blake .

1110
01:20:31,376 --> 01:20:33,334
My grandfather stole it from you .

1111
01:20:36,001 --> 01:20:38,042
I 'm the one who must answer for it .

1112
01:20:52,042 --> 01:20:54,001
I 'm the sixth conspirator .

1113
01:20:56,584 --> 01:20:58,251
I 'm Father Malone .

1114
01:21:00,084 --> 01:21:01,376
Take me .

1115
01:21:06,751 --> 01:21:08,084
[ heavy breathing ]

1116
01:21:24,584 --> 01:21:26,751
[ ominous music ]

1117
01:21:46,209 --> 01:21:48,667
[ Stevie screams ]

1118
01:21:58,292 --> 01:21:59,376
Father Malone !

1119
01:23:39,626 --> 01:23:41,917
[ slow music playing ]

1120
01:24:19,709 --> 01:24:20,709
Look .

1121
01:24:31,126 --> 01:24:32,417
It 's going away .

1122
01:24:43,292 --> 01:24:45,167
[ dog barking in distance ]

1123
01:25:08,709 --> 01:25:11,167
[ Stevie ] I don 't know what happened to Antonio Bay tonight .

1124
01:25:12,584 --> 01:25:16,792
Something came out of the fog and tried to destroy us .

1125
01:25:18,584 --> 01:25:20,584
In one moment , it vanished .

1126
01:25:21,417 --> 01:25:23,709
But if this has been anything but a nightmare

1127
01:25:24,959 --> 01:25:28,084
and if we don 't wake up to find ourselves safe in our beds ,

1128
01:25:29,376 --> 01:25:30,917
it could come again .

1129
01:25:32,834 --> 01:25:34,959
To the ships at sea who can hear my voice ,

1130
01:25:36,417 --> 01:25:39,251
look across the water into the darkness .

1131
01:25:42,042 --> 01:25:43,584
Look for the fog .

1132
01:25:45,959 --> 01:25:47,584
[ doors creaking ]

1133
01:26:13,209 --> 01:26:14,876
Why not six , Blake ?

1134
01:26:15,334 --> 01:26:16,667
[ music stops ]

1135
01:26:18,209 --> 01:26:19,751
[ under breath ] Why not me ?

1136
01:26:29,917 --> 01:26:32,709
[ ominous music fades in ]

